eftovers don't feel  pressure to finish everything on your  plate trust me your body will thank you  tomorrow when you're enjoying a leftover  turkey  totally heartburn free tip 11 skip the  bet try to avoid laying down right after  your meal because standing up actually  promotes really good digestion so you  want to wait at least three hours after  eating before you lay down to bed I know  it's really challenging but for me this  is a really good time to kind of tidy up  the kitchen or the house but I don't  wake up the next morning to a massive  tip twelve go easy on the sweet yes of  course  it's the holidays so definitely say yes  dessert but try to enjoy it in  moderation I always recommend having  smaller portions all of your absolute  favorite and then promising yourself  you'll pack up any leftovers so you  don't feel like you need to eat it all  in one night and tip 13 speak to your  doctor if you're still struggling with  heartburn there may be some  over-the-counter medications that can  work for you so make sure you have this  conversation with your doctor or  pharmacist well I hope these tips were  helpful for eukaryote for me the  holidays are all about spending time as  friends family and indulging in all of  my favorite foods without feeling guilty  making a few really simple small changes  at the table will hopefully save you a  ton of discomfort so you can party the  night away well guys I hope you enjoyed  this video if you did you should give it  a thumbs up leave me a comment below  with some of your burning get it heart  burning toilet talk question subscribe  to the channel and I'll see you next  time on a happy  [Music]  [Applause]
 

